"helpers.rdn" load

[*
*   rmp-reg-command: function that accept list of two values 
*   - command_name: the name of the command that u want to register
*   - function_name: the function that will execute when the command is called
*   - the return value is string option if it's null the function works correctly otherwise u will get a string value contains the error
*   example:
*       ("stop" my-stop) rmp-reg-command call
* *]
rmp-reg-command defun
    tha-params let
    tha-params type tha-params-type let
    tha-params-type "list" != if 
        "rmp-reg-command accept list of two fieds got " tha-params-type append
    else
        tha-params unpack
        rmp-reg-command-native call
    end

end
